          "Step 9 — When a device is gone, it retires — it is not deleted. Wepwawet was sold on 2026-11-24 and retired the same day: his card stays in the system as the record (what he was, his control map, every command ever sent to him), but his control grant is ended and nothing on his card can be sent anymore — not by you, not by Anubis. A new device gets onboarded the same way he was: earn its map once, register it, and grant control only by your hand.",
